  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the cozy warmth of winter with this beautiful cardinal quilt from Jeminise. Featuring a lovely design of red birds nestled among branches, this quilt set brings a peaceful touch of nature into your guest bedroom, vacation home, or master suite. It serves as a thoughtful gift for bird lovers, holidays, housewarmings, or birthdays, with options to customize for a personal touch.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalization options may include size selection, custom text inputs, or optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comforting Fabric:</strong> Made with a breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for consecutive warmth and comfort in all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfectly suited as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, picnic mat, or outdoor companion for camping and backyard lounging.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 5 versatile sizes to fit your needs: Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simple to clean, machine washable in cold water, and dries quickly to remain fluffy and soft.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Red Bird-05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cardinal Bird Winter Floral</td>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt + Pillowcase( Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
